SUMMARY:Table Habit v1.27.15
DESCRIPTION:Table Habit 1.27.15 | mhabit-unsigned\n\n# Released: v1.27.15+2
 04\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- Integrate native desktop title bars and keep ap
 p bars pinned while scrolling\n  (#677)\n  - Fuse macOS window controls wi
 th adaptive toolbars and handle fullscreen\n    transitions\n  - Match nat
 ive title bar colors to the app theme on Windows and Linux\n- Keep a manua
 lly collapsed sidebar closed across layout and interface-style\n  changes 
 within the current session (#679)\n- Restore desktop window size and posit
 ion before the window first appears\n  (#681)\n  - Save ordinary window ge
 ometry without treating fullscreen or maximized\n    bounds as the preferr
 ed window size\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n\n- Preserve open dialogs and their state
  while updating theme colors\, and keep\n  dialog app bars consistent with
  their local theme (#677)\n- Restore the Settings Back button when the sid
 ebar and its collapsed toolbar\n  navigation are hidden (#678)\n\n## 🧹 
 Others\n\n- Add desktop native regression tests and integrate them into lo
 cal and CI\n  test workflows (#677)\n\n[Full Changelog](https://github.com
 /FriesI23/mhabit/compare/v1.27.13+202...v1.27.15+204)
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/tablehabit.json
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
